---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About · Chevron Seven">
  <section class="episode-header">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="eyebrow">Project file</div>
      <h1 class="episode-title">About Chevron Seven</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <article>
        <p>Chevron Seven is a fan-built Stargate rewatch companion. It focuses on the details that become more interesting the second, third or tenth time through: continuity, lore, technology, character dynamics and the wider consequences of each mission.</p>
        <p>It is deliberately not a transcript repository or exhaustive plot wiki. The central editorial question is simple: <strong>why does this episode matter?</strong></p>
        <h2>Critical research instruments</h2>
        <p>The archive also records the O'Neill Sarcasm Rating and Teal'c Eyebrow Index. Historians may judge us.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
